  "details": "There are ~2 strings using the wording of \"Group Plus\", while the rest of the game goes with \"Group+\". No other instance type uses the \"... Plus\" version, only Group ones.\n\nThere's no reason to keep using both, it's inconsistent. The same case as with \"VRChat+\" and \"VRChat Plus\" that got fixed. \n\n\"Group Plus\" should be replaced with \"Group+\", just as \"Invite+\" is never referenced to as \"Invite Plus\".\n\nMoreover, most translators still go with \"Group+\" as the accepted translation for \"Group Plus\" either way. (screenshots)\n\nhttps://crowdin.com/editor/vrchat-application/19/en-pl?view=comfortable&filter=basic&value=0#23555\n\nhttps://crowdin.com/editor/vrchat-application/19/en-pl?view=comfortable&filter=basic&value=0#98880",
